HyperFrames (heygen-com/hyperframes)
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Copyright 2026 HeyGen, Inc.
  Usage:    Runtime dependency. This project invokes the `hyperframes` CLI
            and consumes its published skills; it neither vendors nor
            modifies HyperFrames source.
  Source:   https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes

MiniMax API
  Usage:    Optional TTS / image / video generation via the public MiniMax API.
            The scripts under tools/minimax/ are original works that call the
            public HTTP API; no MiniMax SDK source is included.

Other npm runtime and dev dependencies retain their own licenses, as declared
in package-lock.json.